[{"id":30,"slug":"a-couple-in-a-field-of-yellow-flowers","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/10/a-couple-in-a-field-of-yellow-flowers/","date_gmt":"2026-10-09T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A couple in a field of yellow flowers"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>A portrait session works best when the couple forgets the camera. This one started beside a small fire and moved out into open fields, with one request from me: do what you would do on a day off.</p>\n<p>I kept the lens long and my feet still, and let them wander. The grass and the flowers were the only props, and the weather supplied the sky.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-01.jpg\" alt=\"Couple in coats sitting close together beside a small fire at dusk\" width=\"1064\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A couple sitting close beside a small fire as the light goes.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-02.jpg\" alt=\"Woman in a white sweater leaning against a man in a red check shirt on a grassy field\" width=\"1064\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>She leans back into him, a hazy sky behind them.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-03.jpg\" alt=\"Couple embracing in a grass field under a blue sky with thin clouds\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>The two of them standing close under a wide blue sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>By the fire</h2>\n<p>The light went early, so we began with the warmest frames while there was still colour in the sky. Sitting down made everyone calmer than standing in a row.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-04.jpg\" alt=\"Woman in a white top and jeans walking across a field with one hand held out behind her\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>She walks ahead and holds out her hand to him.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-05.jpg\" alt=\"Couple standing with their heads together in front of a field of yellow flowers\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>Noses almost touching in front of the yellow field.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-06.jpg\" alt=\"Couple sitting back to back on grass under a sky with thin clouds\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>Sitting back to back in the grass, both laughing.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Out in the field</h2>\n<p>Once the fire was out we walked. I asked them to hold hands, then to stop holding hands, and the second version was always the better picture.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-07.jpg\" alt=\"Couple lying on grass with the woman reaching up toward the man's hair\" width=\"1064\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Lying in the grass, she reaches up to his hair.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-08.jpg\" alt=\"Couple lying on their backs on short grass seen from above\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>The two of them on their backs in the grass, seen from above.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-09.jpg\" alt=\"Close view of a man and a woman with glasses, foreheads touching\" width=\"1064\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A close frame of two faces, glasses nearly touching.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The last ten minutes were on the ground. Lying in the grass is a good way to get a real laugh, and a good way to get grass stains.</p>\n<p>We finished in the last blue light and walked back with the fire still warm on our coats. I sent a small selection that evening and the rest a week later.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733572/\">Featured photograph</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733580/\">A couple sitting close beside a small fire as the light goes</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733579/\">She leans back into him, a hazy sky behind them</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733578/\">The two of them standing close under a wide blue sky</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733577/\">She walks ahead and holds out her hand to him</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733576/\">Noses almost touching in front of the yellow field</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733569/\">Sitting back to back in the grass, both laughing</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733564/\">Lying in the grass, she reaches up to his hair</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733562/\">The two of them on their backs in the grass, seen from above</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/35733561/\">A close frame of two faces, glasses nearly touching</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A relaxed couple session that starts at a small fire and moves out into an open field of yellow flowers."},"author":29,"categories":[3],"tags":[5,6],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s09-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":31,"slug":"sunset-on-a-quiet-beach","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/09/sunset-on-a-quiet-beach/","date_gmt":"2026-09-02T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Sunset on a quiet beach"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The plan was short: a beach, the two of them, and the hour before sunset. No guests, no schedule, and a flask for afterwards.</p>\n<p>Elopements are mostly about waiting. The light changes every few minutes, so I picked one spot, stayed in it and let the couple come to me.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-01.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom dancing close on a beach with the setting sun behind them\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A slow dance on the sand with the low sun behind her hair.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-02.jpg\" alt=\"Black and white photo of a bride and groom facing each other with their hands raised\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Hands raised, facing each other, in black and white.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-03.jpg\" alt=\"Bride looking back over her shoulder while the groom smiles beside her at the sea\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>She glances back at the camera and he smiles beside her.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-04.jpg\" alt=\"Couple in wedding clothes smiling on a beach with sunlight flaring behind them\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A step back: both smiling, light flaring from the right.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>We started with a slow dance. They had no music, so they hummed, which gave me a natural smile and a bit of movement in her hair.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-05.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom holding hands in front of them on a beach at sunset\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Holding hands low, hers resting on his.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-06.jpg\" alt=\"Bride laughing with her face against the groom's shoulder on a beach\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>She hides her laughing face against his shoulder.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-07.jpg\" alt=\"Black and white photo of a bride with her hand on the groom's cheek by the sea\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Her hand on his cheek, in black and white.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-08.jpg\" alt=\"Bride with a hand on the groom's jaw as sunlight spills through behind them\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Close, her hand along his jaw, the sun behind them.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>When the sun dropped</h2>\n<p>The sun sat low enough to put a flare across the frame. I stopped fighting it and moved so it landed between them instead of on one of them.</p>\n<p>They were back at the car before the light was gone. We looked through the back of the camera together and agreed on which frames to keep.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15861611/\">Featured photograph</a>, casper somia, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15861595/\">A slow dance on the sand with the low sun behind her hair</a>, casper somia, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15861600/\">Hands raised, facing each other, in black and white</a>, casper somia, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15861602/\">She glances back at the camera and he smiles beside her</a>, casper somia, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15861604/\">A step back: both smiling, light flaring from the right</a>, casper somia, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15861606/\">Holding hands low, hers resting on his</a>, casper somia, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15861608/\">She hides her laughing face against his shoulder</a>, casper somia, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15861609/\">Her hand on his cheek, in black and white</a>, casper somia, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15861610/\">Close, her hand along his jaw, the sun behind them</a>, casper somia, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A two-person elopement on a quiet beach, planned around the last forty minutes of sunlight."},"author":29,"categories":[2],"tags":[7,8],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s07-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":32,"slug":"a-hotel-wedding-with-a-lakeside-hour","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/06/a-hotel-wedding-with-a-lakeside-hour/","date_gmt":"2026-06-20T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A hotel wedding with a lakeside hour"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The couple wanted two kinds of pictures: open air and warm interiors. We spent the late afternoon at a lake, then moved to the hotel for the evening.</p>\n<p>Between the two I needed one lens and one fast prime for the dark bar. Everything else stayed in the bag.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-01.jpg\" alt=\"Groom spinning bride beside a lake with green hills behind them\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A twirl at the water's edge with green hills behind.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-02.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling bride in a strapless gown holding a white parasol on a grassy shore\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The bride with a white paper parasol, laughing.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-03.jpg\" alt=\"Bride with a long veil beside the groom on a hill with mountains behind them\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Her veil lifts in the wind on a bare hillside.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-04.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in a white gown on a dark wooden staircase seen from above\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Back at the hotel: a wooden staircase from above.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>At the lake</h2>\n<p>Wind decided the schedule. A long veil is a lot of fabric on a bare hillside, so we worked fast, and the bride carried a white paper parasol that gave her something to do with her hands.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-05.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom on a stair landing beside a tall window\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A tall window on the stair landing, the groom a few steps ahead.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-06.jpg\" alt=\"Couple kissing in a doorway with a red frame\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A kiss in a doorway framed in red.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-07.jpg\" alt=\"Groom embracing the bride who holds white roses beside a red-lit bar\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>At the bar: his arms around her, her white roses held low.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-08.jpg\" alt=\"Groom kissing the bride on the cheek in front of blurred bar lights\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A kiss on her cheek with the bar lights blurred behind.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Back at the hotel</h2>\n<p>The hotel had a wooden staircase, a tall window on every landing and a red-framed doorway that photographed itself. I mostly stood still and let them walk through it.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-09.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in a satin gown holding a bouquet in a red-framed doorway\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The bride in the red doorway, bouquet in one hand.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-10.jpg\" alt=\"Groom dipping the bride on a dance floor covered in low fog\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>The first dance in low fog and purple light.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The evening closed with a dance floor under low fog and a lot of purple light, which looks better on a screen than in any print.</p>\n<p>I stopped photographing once the cake came out. The last frame I kept is the first dance, because the room had gone quiet for it.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435503/\">Featured photograph</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435504/\">A twirl at the water's edge with green hills behind</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435505/\">The bride with a white paper parasol, laughing</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435502/\">Her veil lifts in the wind on a bare hillside</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435500/\">Back at the hotel: a wooden staircase from above</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435498/\">A tall window on the stair landing, the groom a few steps ahead</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435499/\">A kiss in a doorway framed in red</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435494/\">At the bar: his arms around her, her white roses held low</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435493/\">A kiss on her cheek with the bar lights blurred behind</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435490/\">The bride in the red doorway, bouquet in one hand</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/37435506/\">The first dance in low fog and purple light</a>, Photography Maghradze PH, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A wedding day split between a grassy lakeshore in the afternoon and a hotel bar after dark."},"author":29,"categories":[1],"tags":[9,10],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s01-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":33,"slug":"a-sand-quarry-on-a-cloudy-afternoon","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/05/a-sand-quarry-on-a-cloudy-afternoon/","date_gmt":"2026-05-12T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A sand quarry on a cloudy afternoon"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>This is a working note, not a secret spot. A sand quarry is flat, pale and empty, which makes it one of the easiest places to photograph a couple: there is nothing in the frame except them.</p>\n<p>Heavy cloud helps. The light is even, the sand reflects it back up, and nobody squints.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-01.jpg\" alt=\"Couple standing hand in hand on pale flat sand under a cloudy sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Two people standing hand in hand on pale flat sand under a grey sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-02.jpg\" alt=\"Man in a denim shirt hugging a smiling woman in a red cap on a sand flat\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A hug in the open, her red cap pushed back.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-03.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling woman in a check shirt lying across the lap of a bearded man in a denim shirt\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Close in: she lies across his lap and both of them laugh.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>On the flat</h2>\n<p>Start wide. Put the couple small in the frame and let the bank on the horizon sit in the upper third. Then walk in, a few steps at a time, until you are close enough for faces.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-04.jpg\" alt=\"Couple sitting close together on a sand slope under a cloudy sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Low and wide, sitting close on a sand slope.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-05.jpg\" alt=\"Couple sitting cross-legged on sand and smiling at each other\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Cross-legged on the flat, turned toward each other.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-06.jpg\" alt=\"Couple laughing together while sitting close on sand\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Laughing together at eye level, sitting close on the sand.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Sitting down</h2>\n<p>The sand is soft, so ask them to sit. People relax at ground level, and it saves the shoot from the stiff standing pose.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-07.jpg\" alt=\"Two small figures holding hands on a sand ridge under a cloudy sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Up on the ridge, holding hands against a big sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-08.jpg\" alt=\"Couple walking along a ridge of sand seen from below against a cloudy sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Walking the ridge line, seen from below.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-09.jpg\" alt=\"Man in a denim shirt walking away down a sand slope with tracks behind him\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>One of them walking down the slope with tracks behind him.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The ridge</h2>\n<p>There is a low ridge at the back of the quarry. Shooting up at it gives you a bigger sky and a clean outline, and the tracks in the sand do the rest.</p>\n<p>A last note on sand: it gets into everything. A zip bag for the spare lens and a cloth over the camera body will save a repair bill.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216583/\">Featured photograph</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216552/\">Two people standing hand in hand on pale flat sand under a grey sky</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216551/\">A hug in the open, her red cap pushed back</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216556/\">Close in: she lies across his lap and both of them laugh</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216558/\">Low and wide, sitting close on a sand slope</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216561/\">Cross-legged on the flat, turned toward each other</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216565/\">Laughing together at eye level, sitting close on the sand</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216579/\">Up on the ridge, holding hands against a big sky</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216581/\">Walking the ridge line, seen from below</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/5216582/\">One of them walking down the slope with tracks behind him</a>, Yan Krukau, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A short guide to a flat sand quarry under heavy cloud, and how to make a couple session of nothing but sand and sky."},"author":29,"categories":[4],"tags":[11,12],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s10-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":34,"slug":"a-lake-a-dam-and-a-long-walkway","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2026/02/a-lake-a-dam-and-a-long-walkway/","date_gmt":"2026-02-24T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A lake, a dam and a long walkway"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Water is the easiest backdrop to plan around, because it is rarely in the way. This guide covers a reservoir with a rocky shore, a stone ledge by the dam wall and a straight walkway along the top.</p>\n<p>I shot it on a bright, dry morning with a hard blue sky. I would go back in any season when the water is high and the sun is not straight overhead.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-01.jpg\" alt=\"Man in a white shirt kissing the hand of a woman in a magenta sari seated on a rock by a lake\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>He kisses her hand on a flat rock by the water.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-02.jpg\" alt=\"Couple sitting side by side on a rock beside a lake with green scrub behind\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Side by side on the rock with a green bank behind.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-03.jpg\" alt=\"Couple sitting on sand at a lake shore with large stones in the water\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Sitting on the sand at the shore with stones in the water.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The shore</h2>\n<p>The rock at the water's edge is flat and warm, so it works as a seat. Couples look relaxed sitting down and the lake gives you a clean line behind them.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-04.jpg\" alt=\"Couple sitting on a stone ledge in front of a dam wall above a lake\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>On a stone ledge by the dam wall with the water below.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-05.jpg\" alt=\"Couple walking along a road beside a row of lamp posts under a blue sky\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Walking the dam road, lamp posts in a line.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-06.jpg\" alt=\"Couple standing close with their foreheads almost touching on a road with lamp posts\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Close on the road, foreheads almost touching.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The dam wall</h2>\n<p>The wall and its stone ledge give a hard edge to frame against. Ask the couple to stand a step away from it so the shadows do not fall across their faces.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-07.jpg\" alt=\"Couple standing close at the edge of a lake with a flat far shore behind them\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>At the water, standing close with the far shore behind.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-08.jpg\" alt=\"Couple standing arm in arm in front of a rough stone wall by the water\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>Standing together against a rough stone wall.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-09.jpg\" alt=\"Man in a white shirt with his arm around a woman in a magenta sari beside a lamp post\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A pose by a lamp post with his arm over her shoulder.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The walkway</h2>\n<p>A long straight path makes people walk, and walking gives you motion. The lamp posts repeat down the road and lead the eye to the far end.</p>\n<p>Go early on a weekday. By noon the walkway has cars on it, and the light is flat and white.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781064/\">Featured photograph</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781069/\">He kisses her hand on a flat rock by the water</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781068/\">Side by side on the rock with a green bank behind</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781063/\">Sitting on the sand at the shore with stones in the water</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781062/\">On a stone ledge by the dam wall with the water below</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781057/\">Walking the dam road, lamp posts in a line</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781056/\">Close on the road, foreheads almost touching</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781055/\">At the water, standing close with the far shore behind</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781053/\">Standing together against a rough stone wall</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38781052/\">A pose by a lamp post with his arm over her shoulder</a>, Darshan Dave, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A guide to a reservoir with a rocky shore and a long lamp-lined walkway, for couples who want water in the frame."},"author":29,"categories":[4],"tags":[13,14],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s11-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":35,"slug":"two-people-and-a-mountain-at-sunset","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/11/two-people-and-a-mountain-at-sunset/","date_gmt":"2025-11-18T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Two people and a mountain at sunset"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>They wrote to me in the spring with one request: no guests, no schedule, a mountain. We agreed on an evening in autumn, when the light is low and the ridge is empty.</p>\n<p>High ground is hard to photograph because everything is far away. The job is to find the one thing that is close, a hand, a veil, a step, and wait for it.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-01.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom kissing in warm backlight with hills behind them\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A kiss on the ridge with the sun behind the hills.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-02.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom dancing on a grassy hillside at sunset\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A slow dance in the grass, her gown full of wind.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-03.jpg\" alt=\"Groom spinning the bride in a white gown on a hillside\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>He turns her under his arm.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>We drove most of the way up and walked the last twenty minutes. The ceremony took five minutes, after which they asked for a dance, so we gave them the next hour.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-04.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in a tulle gown standing in grass while the groom in a dark suit looks toward a hill\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>She stands in the grass with her gown spread while he looks to the hill.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-05.jpg\" alt=\"Groom seen from behind with the bride's hand on his neck against a dark hill\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Her hand on the back of his neck, seen from behind.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-06.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom embracing on a bare hillside under a pale sky with a small moon\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>An embrace on a bare slope with the moon above.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-07.jpg\" alt=\"Groom in a white shirt holding his jacket over his shoulder, facing hills, with the bride a few steps away\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>He looks out at the hills with his jacket over his shoulder.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Dancing in the grass</h2>\n<p>There was no music and a lot of wind. She lifted her skirt, he turned her under his arm, and I changed almost nothing between frames except where I stood.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-08.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom standing a little apart in front of layered hills in haze\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The two of them a little apart on a layered ridge.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-09.jpg\" alt=\"Layered mountain valley in warm haze with no people\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The valley in haze after the sun left.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-10.jpg\" alt=\"Silhouettes of a couple kissing against a dark sky with a red glow on the horizon\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Last frame: two silhouettes against a red horizon.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>After the light</h2>\n<p>When the sun went behind the hill we stopped chasing it and looked for what was left: the valley in haze, the two of them as shapes.</p>\n<p>We were back at the car with the heater on before it was fully dark. The drive down was quiet, and the photographs were still warm.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123054/\">Featured photograph</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123057/\">A kiss on the ridge with the sun behind the hills</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123061/\">A slow dance in the grass, her gown full of wind</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123064/\">He turns her under his arm</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123066/\">She stands in the grass with her gown spread while he looks to the hill</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123070/\">Her hand on the back of his neck, seen from behind</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123074/\">An embrace on a bare slope with the moon above</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123076/\">He looks out at the hills with his jacket over his shoulder</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123078/\">The two of them a little apart on a layered ridge</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123081/\">The valley in haze after the sun left</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33123082/\">Last frame: two silhouettes against a red horizon</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"An elopement on a bare mountain ridge, with no guests and a short list of rules about the wind."},"author":29,"categories":[2],"tags":[15,16],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s05-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":36,"slug":"a-garden-wedding-in-the-afternoon","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/09/a-garden-wedding-in-the-afternoon/","date_gmt":"2025-09-30T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A garden wedding in the afternoon"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The day was slow on purpose. They arrived in a white car, walked through a garden of tall pines and lavender, and stopped wherever the light was good.</p>\n<p>I stayed within a few steps of them all afternoon and kept the camera low. In a garden the light changes with every few paces.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-01.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom sitting in the open door of a white car, the bride holding a bouquet\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The couple in the back of a white car, the door open.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-02.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom standing in front of a park fountain with red flowers\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>By a fountain with red flowers in the foreground.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-03.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in a long gown holding the groom's hand and walking on a garden path\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A walk through the garden, hand in hand.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-04.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom standing among lavender plants with tall pines behind them\" width=\"988\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Standing in a bed of lavender with pines behind.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The garden</h2>\n<p>A fountain with a bed of red flowers, a path lined with lavender, and a lawn under tall pines. The couple took each of them as a pause, and I took the pictures between the pauses.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-05.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom in a dark garden setting smiling at the camera, his arm around her\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The two of them smiling at the camera among dark trees.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-06.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in a long veil sitting on grass holding a bouquet of white flowers\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The bride seated with a bouquet of white flowers.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-07.jpg\" alt=\"Close portrait of a bride with her face beside a bouquet of white roses\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A close frame with her face half in the flowers.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The bride carried a small bouquet of white flowers all day. In close frames it gave her something to look at and her hands something to hold.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-08.jpg\" alt=\"Close view of a pearl earring and a veil edge on a bride\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Her earring and the edge of her veil.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-09.jpg\" alt=\"Two hands wearing wedding rings seen from below against a pale sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>The rings on his and her hands against a pale sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-10.jpg\" alt=\"Silhouettes of a groom lifting a bride in purple stage light\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Late in the evening, the two of them in purple stage light.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Evening</h2>\n<p>The reception ran into the dark, so I took a few frames of the rings and ended the day on the dance floor with the lights on.</p>\n<p>I sent the gallery nine days later, with a short note on which frames I would print first. The garden ones were always at the top.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051785/\">Featured photograph</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051768/\">The couple in the back of a white car, the door open</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051775/\">By a fountain with red flowers in the foreground</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051781/\">A walk through the garden, hand in hand</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051779/\">Standing in a bed of lavender with pines behind</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051844/\">The two of them smiling at the camera among dark trees</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051829/\">The bride seated with a bouquet of white flowers</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051831/\">A close frame with her face half in the flowers</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051783/\">Her earring and the edge of her veil</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051825/\">The rings on his and her hands against a pale sky</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/33051851/\">Late in the evening, the two of them in purple stage light</a>, Владимир Высоцкий, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A wedding that moved from a white car to a park garden, with a fountain, a lavender bed and a long evening."},"author":29,"categories":[1],"tags":[17,18],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s03-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":37,"slug":"getting-ready-with-two-small-dogs","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/06/getting-ready-with-two-small-dogs/","date_gmt":"2025-06-10T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Getting ready with two small dogs"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>I got to the house at nine and the first thing I photographed was a dog in a tiny tuxedo. That set the mood for the morning: calm, a little silly, and busy with small objects.</p>\n<p>Getting ready is the part of the day with the most detail and the least pressure, so I use it to look at things closely.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-01.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in a white lace-sleeved dress sitting by a dark door and looking down\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The bride by a dark door in a lace-sleeved dress.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-02.jpg\" alt=\"Hand with a gold ring resting on lace sleeve fabric\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A gold ring on her hand, held against the lace.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-03.jpg\" alt=\"Close view of a diamond choker necklace on a bride's collarbone\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A diamond choker at the collarbone.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The bride</h2>\n<p>She was dressed early and spent the rest of the time in a chair by a dark door, looking at her hands. The lace sleeves and a plain gold ring were all I needed.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-04.jpg\" alt=\"Bride half hidden behind a white feather fan with pearl lettering\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The bride behind a feather fan lettered with her title.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-05.jpg\" alt=\"Beige shoes, a perfume bottle and an invitation on a wooden table beside a mirror\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Shoes, perfume and a painted invitation on a table by a mirror.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-06.jpg\" alt=\"White suit jacket on a hanger above a pair of black shoes in a bright room\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A pale jacket and black shoes, waiting.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-07.jpg\" alt=\"Man's hand fastening a steel watch on a white suit cuff\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A watch being fastened on a cuff.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Small things</h2>\n<p>A pair of shoes beside a mirror, an invitation painted with a villa, a pale jacket on its hanger, a watch being fastened. Each is a quick frame, and each is something the couple remembers.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-08.jpg\" alt=\"Open box with a pair of silver cufflinks held in a hand\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A small box of cufflinks, held open.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-09.jpg\" alt=\"Bulldog wearing a black tuxedo collar looking up at the camera\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A small dog in a tuxedo collar, looking up.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-10.jpg\" alt=\"Small long-haired dog in a grey tulle skirt with a red bow in its hair\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The second dog, in a grey tulle skirt.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The dogs</h2>\n<p>The two dogs wore matching wedding outfits, and they behaved for exactly as long as it took me to find the right chair.</p>\n<p>They both ended the morning asleep under a table. We took our last frame of the room, collected the dogs and left for the ceremony.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550738/\">Featured photograph</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550748/\">The bride by a dark door in a lace-sleeved dress</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550746/\">A gold ring on her hand, held against the lace</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550736/\">A diamond choker at the collarbone</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550740/\">The bride behind a feather fan lettered with her title</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550739/\">Shoes, perfume and a painted invitation on a table by a mirror</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550733/\">A pale jacket and black shoes, waiting</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550730/\">A watch being fastened on a cuff</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550727/\">A small box of cufflinks, held open</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550728/\">A small dog in a tuxedo collar, looking up</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40550744/\">The second dog, in a grey tulle skirt</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A quiet morning at home before a wedding, with a lace dress, two small dogs in wedding clothes and a lot of small things."},"author":29,"categories":[1],"tags":[19,20],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s04-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":38,"slug":"cliffs-lava-fields-and-a-big-tree","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/04/cliffs-lava-fields-and-a-big-tree/","date_gmt":"2025-04-22T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Cliffs, lava fields and a big tree"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Not every ceremony needs a venue. This guide collects places where two people and a photographer can be the only ones for miles: a lava field, a black beach, a cliff edge, a big tree.</p>\n<p>Each one has a different rule. Wind, weather and access decide the plan more than the camera does.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-01.jpg\" alt=\"Couple walking across a dark lava field under a pale sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A couple crossing a dark lava field, small under a pale sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-02.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a couple in blue and white on black sand\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>Two people on black sand, seen from above.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-03.jpg\" alt=\"Couple standing at the edge of a wide empty beach with a wave behind\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"><figcaption>A couple at the edge of a long, empty beach.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Open ground</h2>\n<p>Lava and black sand are dark, so a white dress stands out from far away. A long lens helps, and a drone does the rest, but check the local rules first.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-04.jpg\" alt=\"Two tiny figures on a grassy cliff above a rocky coast at sunset\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A rocky coast in warm light, the couple far along it.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-05.jpg\" alt=\"Bride reading from a card to the groom among tall trees in a cool forest\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Vows read from a card among tall trunks.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-06.jpg\" alt=\"Couple standing small beneath a very large tree on a green field\" width=\"1600\" height=\"952\"><figcaption>A very large tree on a green hill, the couple at its foot.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The edge of the land</h2>\n<p>A long beach, a coast of cliffs and a rocky shore. Put the couple small in the frame and let the horizon sit low.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-07.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of two people walking on a snowy plain with low bushes\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1280\"><figcaption>A snowy plain with two people walking.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-08.jpg\" alt=\"Couple embracing on a white porch with a bouquet and misty trees behind\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A rainy porch: his arms around her, a bouquet between them.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-09.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a tiny figure on a moss-covered lava field\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1066\"><figcaption>A tiny figure on mossy ground, from high above.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Trees and weather</h2>\n<p>A cool forest, a big tree on a green hill and a snowy plain. Quiet places that work best in the weather other people avoid.</p>\n<p>A last note: whatever the place, check the weather and tell someone where you are going. The picture is never worth the cliff.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898046/\">Featured photograph</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898041/\">A couple crossing a dark lava field, small under a pale sky</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898044/\">Two people on black sand, seen from above</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898047/\">A couple at the edge of a long, empty beach</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898048/\">A rocky coast in warm light, the couple far along it</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898049/\">Vows read from a card among tall trunks</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898050/\">A very large tree on a green hill, the couple at its foot</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898051/\">A snowy plain with two people walking</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898053/\">A rainy porch: his arms around her, a bouquet between them</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/15898043/\">A tiny figure on mossy ground, from high above</a>, Josh Withers, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A guide to wild places that work for a small ceremony, from a lava field to a snowy plain and one very large tree."},"author":29,"categories":[4],"tags":[21,22],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s12-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":39,"slug":"sunglasses-sea-breeze-and-a-white-arch","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/03/sunglasses-sea-breeze-and-a-white-arch/","date_gmt":"2025-03-04T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"Sunglasses, sea breeze and a white arch"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>This elopement was built around a sea breeze and a pair of dark glasses. No guests, no speeches, just a planned list of places we wanted to visit in one afternoon.</p>\n<p>We started on the beach for the soft light, moved to a garden arch and finished at a coloured wall that the couple had picked from a magazine.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-01.jpg\" alt=\"Groom in sunglasses and braces being kissed on the cheek by the bride on a sandy slope with scrub\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A kiss on the cheek at the top of the beach, his glasses on.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-02.jpg\" alt=\"Bride and groom with their foreheads together on a pebble beach\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Foreheads together on the pebbles.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-03.jpg\" alt=\"Groom holding the bride's hand up as she twirls on a pebble shore\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A twirl at the water's edge, her sleeves puffed in the wind.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-04.jpg\" alt=\"Couple walking in shallow water by a hillside with the bride holding a bouquet\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Walking the shoreline with her bouquet low.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The beach</h2>\n<p>Pebbles, low scrub and the sea close by. The wind made her skirt do the work, and the sunglasses meant they could relax without squinting.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-05.jpg\" alt=\"Groom in a tuxedo and bride in a gown standing in front of a white arch with flowers\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>In front of a white arch with a fence and flowers.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-06.jpg\" alt=\"Groom with a hand on the bride's cheek in front of a hanging cord arch\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>At a macrame arch, his hand on her cheek.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-07.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in sunglasses reflected in a gilt-framed mirror against a pale blue wall\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The bride in a gold mirror, glasses on.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The arch</h2>\n<p>A white arch with hanging cords stood in a grass field. They stood in it, I stood back, and the cords moved in the breeze behind them.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-08.jpg\" alt=\"Groom seated on a pink sofa and the bride standing behind it against an orange wall\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A pink velvet sofa on an orange wall, he sits and she stands behind.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-09.jpg\" alt=\"Bride holding white tulips with the groom standing behind her in front of a white fence\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The bride with white tulips, the groom behind her.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-10.jpg\" alt=\"Black and white photo of a couple with their foreheads together on a beach\" width=\"900\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The last frame, foreheads together, in black and white.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The wall</h2>\n<p>A warm orange wall, a pink velvet sofa and a bunch of white tulips. We took ten minutes there and kept all of it.</p>\n<p>The glasses came off for the last two frames. I kept one of those, in black and white, as the album cover.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797737/\">Featured photograph</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797745/\">A kiss on the cheek at the top of the beach, his glasses on</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797740/\">Foreheads together on the pebbles</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797736/\">A twirl at the water's edge, her sleeves puffed in the wind</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797735/\">Walking the shoreline with her bouquet low</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797743/\">In front of a white arch with a fence and flowers</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797732/\">At a macrame arch, his hand on her cheek</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797738/\">The bride in a gold mirror, glasses on</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797742/\">A pink velvet sofa on an orange wall, he sits and she stands behind</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797726/\">The bride with white tulips, the groom behind her</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/38797725/\">The last frame, foreheads together, in black and white</a>, Olcay Ertem, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A small elopement day that moved between a pebble beach, a white flower arch and a studio wall in orange and pink."},"author":29,"categories":[2],"tags":[23,24],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s06-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":40,"slug":"a-forest-clearing-and-an-old-terracotta-wall","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2025/01/a-forest-clearing-and-an-old-terracotta-wall/","date_gmt":"2025-01-14T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A forest clearing and an old terracotta wall"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The couple picked their clothes to match the colours of the place: a red dress and a white shirt for the forest, and white and patterned clothes for the old walls.</p>\n<p>The location worked in two halves, so I planned it that way. Trees and a track in the morning, brick, columns and steps once the sun was high.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-01.jpg\" alt=\"Couple sitting on the ground in a forest, the woman in red holding a straw hat\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>Sitting on the forest floor with a straw hat in her lap.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-02.jpg\" alt=\"Couple leaning together and smiling in a forest clearing\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>Leaning together and looking at each other.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-03.jpg\" alt=\"Man lifting a woman in a red dress off the ground in a forest\" width=\"1064\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>He lifts her off the ground with her head thrown back.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>In the trees</h2>\n<p>Forests are all the same height, so the job is to find a gap. We found a clearing with soft ground to sit on, and the red dress did the rest.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-04.jpg\" alt=\"Couple in sunglasses holding a bunch of yellow flowers in front of a clay bank\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>On a clay bank, with sunglasses, a sun hat and yellow flowers.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-05.jpg\" alt=\"Man with his hands on a woman's face on a quiet road bordered by trees\" width=\"1064\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>On a quiet road with his hands on her face.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-06.jpg\" alt=\"Couple standing apart between stone columns in white and patterned clothes\" width=\"1064\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Standing apart between pale stone columns.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The road</h2>\n<p>A narrow road with trees on both sides. I asked them to stand close and ignore me, and the closest frames came from the longest minute.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-07.jpg\" alt=\"Man standing and woman sitting on the steps of a carved terracotta doorway\" width=\"1064\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>At a carved red-brown doorway, he stands and she sits.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-08.jpg\" alt=\"Couple sitting on bright red steps between white pillars\" width=\"1064\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Sitting together on red steps between white pillars.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-09.jpg\" alt=\"Couple facing each other and holding hands beside an old brick wall under a blue sky\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1065\"><figcaption>Face to face beside a brick wall.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The old wall</h2>\n<p>Terracotta carving, white pillars and red steps. Colours like these do not need much help, so I framed them straight.</p>\n<p>I finished with one frame of the wall on its own, because the colour on it was better than anything I could add.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837468/\">Featured photograph</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837469/\">Sitting on the forest floor with a straw hat in her lap</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837466/\">Leaning together and looking at each other</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837464/\">He lifts her off the ground with her head thrown back</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837463/\">On a clay bank, with sunglasses, a sun hat and yellow flowers</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837461/\">On a quiet road with his hands on her face</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837459/\">Standing apart between pale stone columns</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837458/\">At a carved red-brown doorway, he stands and she sits</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837457/\">Sitting together on red steps between white pillars</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/34837456/\">Face to face beside a brick wall</a>, Amodita's Frame, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A couple portrait session on a forest floor, a quiet road and the steps of an old terracotta building."},"author":29,"categories":[3],"tags":[25,26],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s08-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}},{"id":41,"slug":"a-brides-morning-above-the-rooftops","link":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/samples/second-shooter/2024/11/a-brides-morning-above-the-rooftops/","date_gmt":"2024-11-12T09:00:00","title":{"rendered":"A bride's morning above the rooftops"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>The room was at the top of a building with a glass walkway on one side and a view of the town on the other. The light there is best early in the day.</p>\n<p>I arrived before the hair and makeup and stayed until she was dressed. Most of the frames are details, because a good morning is made of them.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-01.jpg\" alt=\"View over a town's rooftops under a pale overcast sky\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The town from the window, roofs under a white sky.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-02.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in a white satin robe leaning on a glass and steel walkway\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A robe, a headband and a glass walkway.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-03.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in a pearl headband having blusher brushed on her cheek\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A soft brush on her cheek.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Before the dress</h2>\n<p>A view over the roofs and a robe on the walkway, then makeup. The brush, a little powder, and the profile that goes with it.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-04.jpg\" alt=\"Bride in a lace bolero spraying perfume in front of a gold-framed mirror\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Perfume in front of a gold-framed mirror.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-05.jpg\" alt=\"Hands holding a perfume bottle in front of a lace-sleeved wedding dress\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A bottle of perfume held against a white lace sleeve.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-06.jpg\" alt=\"Silver cross and two rings lying on dark tulle\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>A cross and two rings on a bed of dark tulle.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>Small things</h2>\n<p>A bottle of perfume held against lace, a silver cross and two rings on a bed of tulle, a gold-framed mirror with a tall plant beside it.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-07.jpg\" alt=\"White wedding dress hanging on a glass and steel walkway with a view of roofs\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>The dress on the walkway with the town beyond.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img src=\"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-08.jpg\" alt=\"Lace-shouldered wedding dress on a hanger by a bright window\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"><figcaption>Lace shoulders on a hanger by a window.</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>The dress</h2>\n<p>The dress hung on the walkway until she was ready, with the town behind it. I took it once on the rail and once on its hanger indoors.</p>\n<p>She put the dress on at eleven, and I stopped photographing the room. The last frame of the morning is the lace shoulders on their hanger.</p>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<p>The photographs are from Pexels, each listed below with its photographer.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40618545/\">Featured photograph</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40618556/\">The town from the window, roofs under a white sky</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40618558/\">A robe, a headband and a glass walkway</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40618553/\">A soft brush on her cheek</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40618547/\">Perfume in front of a gold-framed mirror</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40618552/\">A bottle of perfume held against a white lace sleeve</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40618549/\">A cross and two rings on a bed of dark tulle</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40618548/\">The dress on the walkway with the town beyond</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pexels.com/photo/40618542/\">Lace shoulders on a hanger by a window</a>, Alexander Mass, Pexels licence</li>\n</ul>"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"A bride's morning on a glass walkway above a town, with perfume, pearls and a lace dress on a hanger."},"author":29,"categories":[1],"tags":[27,28],"_embedded":{"wp:featuredmedia":[{"source_url":"https://keyturnkit.github.io/demo/second-shooter/s02-cover.jpg"}],"author":[{"id":29,"name":"Second Shooter","slug":"secondshooter"}]}}]